  summary: "In 1815 the Congress of Vienna created a German Confederation of 39 states dominated by Austria. The Zollverein of 1834 built economic unity, and after 1862 Bismarck used realpolitik and the Blood and Iron policy to unite Germany through three wars: the Danish War of 1864, the Seven Weeks War of 1866 and the Franco-Prussian War of 1870-71. Prussia defeated Austria at Sadowa and France at Sedan, and in 1871 the German Empire was proclaimed at Versailles with King William as Kaiser.",
